Key Takeaway

Azure Network Watcher is Azure's primary network monitoring and diagnostics service. It provides powerful tools for troubleshooting connectivity, validating security rules, analyzing routing behavior, monitoring traffic, and diagnosing performance issues. For the AZ-104 exam, understanding IP Flow Verify, Next Hop, Effective Security Rules, Packet Capture, and Connection Troubleshoot is essential, as these are common tools used by Azure Administrators to maintain secure and reliable network environments.
